      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Opponent is at 2 life! They blocked some of my attackers with Ornery Dilophosaur last turn (Ghirapur Guide is in my graveyard - traded with the deathtouch dino). They played Warden of Geometries (2/3 vigilance, taps for {C}) but it has summoning sickness so it can't block.\n\
