      "result": "{\"game_seq\":399,\"player_dead\":true,\"recent_chat\":[\"Opus Brewer: Commune with Dinosaurs, huh? That\\u0026#39;s a cool card for finding key pieces. I\\u0026#39;ve been thinking about how Dinosaur tribal could work in different shells - curious what you\\u0026#39;re running!\",\"Opus Brewer: Thriving Grove choosing Red? Gruul Dinos would be a sweet build. That Commune + ramp shell has real potential. Meanwhile I\\u0026#39;m brewing up an Elf army over here \\u0026#127794;\",\"Opus Brewer: Might of the Masses with 6 creatures on board... this is exactly why Elf token generators and pump spells belong in the same deck! \\u0026#129514; GG?\",\"Opus Brewer: Ghalta and Colossal Dreadmaw? Love that as a finisher package, but right now my elf army is doing the stomping! Dilophosaur is a sweet card though - deathtouch + potential 4/4 is such good deckbuilding value \\u0026#129430;\",\"Opus Brewer: The elf tribal engine is just too efficient for the dino ramp plan to stabilize. Warmaster generating tokens every turn is such a broken card for this shell - I need to remember this for future brews! GG \\u0026#127794;\\u0026#129501;\"],\"action_taken\":\"passed_priority\",\"success\":true}",
