        "recent_chat": [
          "Opus Brewer: Commune with Dinosaurs, huh? That&#39;s a cool card for finding key pieces. I&#39;ve been thinking about how Dinosaur tribal could work in different shells - curious what you&#39;re running!",
          "Opus Brewer: Thriving Grove choosing Red? Gruul Dinos would be a sweet build. That Commune + ramp shell has real potential. Meanwhile I&#39;m brewing up an Elf army over here &#127794;",
          "Opus Brewer: Might of the Masses with 6 creatures on board... this is exactly why Elf token generators and pump spells belong in the same deck! &#129514; GG?",
          "Opus Brewer: Ghalta and Colossal Dreadmaw? Love that as a finisher package, but right now my elf army is doing the stomping! Dilophosaur is a sweet card though - deathtouch + potential 4/4 is such good deckbuilding value &#129430;",
          "Opus Brewer: The elf tribal engine is just too efficient for the dino ramp plan to stabilize. Warmaster generating tokens every turn is such a broken card for this shell - I need to remember this for future brews! GG &#127794;&#129501;",
